{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0267","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000000ff:text","row":36306,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"待っていると。","en":"As I waited—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901068","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00001","en":"As I am waiting,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000001ab:text","row":36307,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「せんぱーい！」","en":"“Taichiii!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901069","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00002","en":"Miki: \"Seeenpaaai!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000001d3:text","row":36308,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"霧を連れて、美希がやってきた。","en":"Miki arrived with Kiri in tow.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901070","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00003","en":"Miki had come, bringing Kiri with.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000211:text","row":36309,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「よ」","en":"“Hey.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901071","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00004","en":"Taichi: \"Yo.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000002b5:text","row":36310,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「待ちました？」","en":"“Have you been waiting long?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901072","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00005","en":"Miki: \"Been waiting?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000002e5:text","row":36311,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「これから来るとこサ！」","en":"“I haven't even gotten here yet!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901073","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00006","en":"Taichi: \"I was just about to show up, sir!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000315:text","row":36312,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"小粋なギャグが挨拶がわりな俺たちだった。","en":"That snappy little routine passed for a greeting between us.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901074","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00007","en":"Snappy jokes were a substitute greeting for us.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000003db:text","row":36313,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「いやー、説得に手間取っちゃって、すいません」","en":"“Sorry. It took a while to persuade her.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901075","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00008","en":"Miki: \"Welll, persuasion has met unexpected difficulties, apologies.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000004fb:text","row":36314,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「……説得というか……説得というかっ……」","en":"“...Persuasion? You call that persuasion!?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901076","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00009","en":"Kiri: \"...persuasion she calls it... persuasion she calls it...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:0000053d:text","row":36315,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"霧は不満たらたらだった。","en":"Kiri had grievances to spare.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901077","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00010","en":"Dissatisfaction was trickling incessantly from Kiri.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000005f3:text","row":36316,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「性欲をもてあます」","en":"“All that pent-up libido.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901078","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00011","en":"Miki: \"Sexual desire incontrollable.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese is a complete statement that the speaker cannot control or has more sexual desire than she knows what to do with. The English uses the nonstandard adjective 'incontrollable' in an ungrammatical fragment.","remedy":"I can't control my sexual desire.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":36,"start":7,"text":"Sexual desire incontrollable."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:0000061f:text","row":36317,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"ぼそっと言う。","en":"Miki muttered under her breath.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901079","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00012","en":"So she said in a whisper.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000006ac:text","row":36318,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901080","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00013","en":"Kiri: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000006d0:text","row":36319,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"おとなしくなった。","en":"Kiri quieted down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901081","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00014","en":"She grew obedient.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000006fa:text","row":36320,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"霧はどんな秘密を握られているんだろう。","en":"What kind of dirt did Miki have on her?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901082","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00015","en":"What secret could Kiri possibly be hiding?","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese passive says that someone has a secret of Kiri's in hand and is using it as leverage over her. The English instead makes Kiri the person concealing a secret and loses the leverage relationship.","remedy":"What kind of secret does she have on Kiri, I wonder?","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":42,"start":0,"text":"What secret could Kiri possibly be hiding?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000740:text","row":36321,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃあどこ行こうか？」","en":"“So where should we go?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901083","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00016","en":"Taichi: \"Well, where do we go?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000007f6:text","row":36322,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「やまー！」","en":"“The mountaaain!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901084","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00017","en":"Miki: \"Mountaaain!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000822:text","row":36323,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「……山？」","en":"“...The mountain?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901085","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00018","en":"Taichi: \"...yama?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000008cc:text","row":36324,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「山の上から、三人で街並をながめるデート！」","en":"“A three-person date, looking down over the town from the mountaintop!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901086","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00019","en":"Miki: \"Our date will be for us three to gaze at the townscape from the mountaintop!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000918:text","row":36325,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「疲れそう。いいけど」","en":"“Sounds tiring. Fine by me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901087","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Sounds tiring. But nice.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000009cc:text","row":36326,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧ちんもいーよね？」","en":"“You're good with that too, right, Kiri-kins?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901088","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00021","en":"Miki: \"You like it too, Kiri-chin, right?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000a7e:text","row":36327,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いいも何も、逆らえない」","en":"“...It’s not as if I’m allowed to say no.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901089","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00022","en":"Kiri: \"...like it or whatever, I can't oppose this.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000ad9:text","row":36328,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃＧＯ！」","en":"“Then let's GO!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901090","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00023","en":"Miki: \"Then GO!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000aff:text","row":36329,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"美希は右腕を組んでくる。","en":"Miki linked her right arm through mine.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901091","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00024","en":"Miki takes my right arm.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000bb5:text","row":36330,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほらほら、腕組むです」","en":"“Come on, come on. Arms!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901092","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00025","en":"Miki: \"Come on, come on, let's link arms!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000bed:text","row":36331,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、ああ……」","en":"“R-right...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901093","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00026","en":"Taichi: \"Ah, 'k...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000c15:text","row":36332,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"で、反対側で霧と腕を組む。","en":"Then she linked her other arm with Kiri’s.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901094","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00027","en":"And, on the opposite side, she links arms with Kiri.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000ccb:text","row":36333,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はいはい」","en":"“...Fine, fine.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901095","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00028","en":"Kiri: \"...aye aye.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000e58:text","row":36334,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"三人はぎこちなく歩く。","en":"The three of us set out awkwardly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901096","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00029","en":"An awkward walk in trio.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000e86:text","row":36335,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"合わない歩幅。","en":"Our strides didn't match.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901097","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00030","en":"A walking pace that never matches,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000eac:text","row":36336,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"戸惑いの空気。","en":"Uncertainty hung between us.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901098","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00031","en":"confusion in the air,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000ed2:text","row":36337,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"ズレた意気込み。","en":"Our enthusiasm was out of sync.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901099","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00032","en":"and the enthusiasm has slipped off.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["word_choice","undertranslation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000efa:text","row":36338,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"なんとも、うちららしくはある。","en":"It was very much like us.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901100","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00033","en":"It's so like us, so very much.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00000f38:text","row":36339,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「ねえねえ、こういうのって、俺が真ん中じゃないの？」","en":"“Hey, isn't the guy supposed to be in the middle?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901101","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00034","en":"Taichi: \"Say, say, but shouldn't I be in the middle when walking like this?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:0000100a:text","row":36340,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「これでいーのですよ」","en":"“Nope, this is right.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901102","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00035","en":"Miki: \"We're fiiine like this!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000010f0:text","row":36341,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"霧と目を合わせる。","en":"I caught Kiri's eye.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901103","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00036","en":"I meet Kiri's eyes.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:0000111a:text","row":36342,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"ぷい。","en":"Hmph.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901104","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00037","en":"Pfui!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00001138:text","row":36343,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"そらされた。","en":"She turned away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901105","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00038","en":"She turns away.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00001164:text","row":36344,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ま、いっか」","en":"“...Whatever.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901106","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00039","en":"Taichi: \"...well, whatev'.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:0000118e:text","row":36345,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"三人で歩く。","en":"The three of us walked on.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901107","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00040","en":"We walk in trio.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000011b2:text","row":36346,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"ちょっと歩きにくかったけど、頑張った。","en":"It wasn't easy walking that way, but I kept at it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901108","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00041","en":"It was kind of hard to walk this way, but we gave it all.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:00001276:text","row":36347,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「いそがないと日が暮れますね」","en":"“We'd better hurry before the sun sets.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901109","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00042","en":"Miki: \"If we don't hurry the sun will sink and the day go dark!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:000012b4:text","row":36348,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「急ぐか」","en":"“Then let's hurry.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901110","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00043","en":"Taichi: \"Shall we hurry?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0267:0000135c:text","row":36349,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「いそげっ、いそげっ」","en":"“Move it, move it!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901111","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4008:00044","en":"Miki: \"Hur-ry! Hur-ry!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
